---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Guides"
  description="Practical guides on SVG, frontend development, and technical SEO from Pixelquil."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 text-center">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      Coming soon
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
      Guides
    </h1>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-600">
      In-depth, practical guides on SVG workflows, frontend development, and technical SEO are
      on the way. In the meantime, every tool page includes its own how-it-works walkthrough
      and FAQ section to help you get the most out of it.
    </p>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-8 flex max-w-md flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
      <a href="/svg-tools/"
        class="rounded-lg bg-brand-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-700"
      >
        Browse SVG Tools
      </a>
      <a href="/developer-tools/"
        class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600"
      >
        Browse Developer Tools
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>